# readme.txt changelog spacing

In `== Changelog ==` and `== Upgrade Notice ==`, separate version blocks with one blank line.

Do not insert a second blank line before the next `= X.Y.Z =` heading. `bin/update-changelog.sh check <version>` fails when either section has consecutive blank lines.
